## Bar charts (cont.) {.scrollable}

Need to clean up the data a bit. 


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
unique(dat$education)
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```
 [1] "O Level"                 "Higher National Diploma"
 [3] "Bachelor Degree"         "National Diploma"       
 [5] "A Level"                 "PhD"                    
 [7] "Lower Secondary"         "National Certificate"   
 [9] "Diploma"                 "Master Degree"          
